{"title":"202506 青少年软件编程等级考试Scratch二级真题","subject":"scratch","subjectName":"Scratch","level":2,"yearmonth":"202506","year":"2025","count":37,"questions":[{"no":1,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"角色“飞机”运行如下左图所示的程序，角色“云朵”运行如下右图所示的程序，两者的运动方向是？（ ）"},{"img":"assets/images/17523897398734.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"飞机向左，云朵向右"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"飞机向右，云朵向左"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"两者均向右"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"两者均向左"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"90度方向为右，-90度为左。","auto":true},{"no":2,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"默认小猫角色，运行下列程序后，舞台上会绘制出什么图形？（ ）"},{"img":"assets/images/17523898557841.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17523898666558.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17523898725173.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17523898778596.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17523898839453.png"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"每次移动50步后右转90度，重复4次形成闭合正方形。","auto":true},{"no":3,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"小熊在舞台上，如果碰到舞台边缘就左转90度，否则就继续前进，下列哪个选项程序是正确的？（ ）"},{"img":"assets/images/17523899478984.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17523899661426.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17523899722243.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17523899782832.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17523899842725.png"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"题目要求碰到舞台边缘左转，否则前进，选项 A 符合这一逻辑；选项 B 碰到边缘前进，否则左转，不符合要求；选项 C 碰到边缘右转，不符合题意；选项 D 碰到边缘前进否则右转，也不符合要求。","auto":true},{"no":4,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"从舞台左侧移动到右侧（距离300步），每次移动20步，需要重复执行几次？（ ）"},{"img":"assets/images/17523920801595.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"10次"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"15次"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"20次"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"30次"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"总距离300步，每次20步，300÷20=15 次","auto":true},{"no":5,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"默认小猫角色，运行下列程序后，音量的值是？（ ）"},{"img":"assets/images/17523921321161.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"50%"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"70%"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"20%"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"30%"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"音量初始设为50%，增加20后为70%。","auto":true},{"no":6,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"若要计算24除以6的商，应使用下列哪个选项的运算积木？（ ）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17523922357601.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17523922418249.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17523922469459.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17523922527501.png"}]}],"answer":"D","analysis":"除法运算积木","auto":true},{"no":7,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"观察数列：2, 5, 10, 17, 26, ( )，括号内应填？（ ）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"35"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"37"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"40"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"45"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"规律为：n*n+1 （n从1开始）","auto":true},{"no":8,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"下列积木的值是？（ ）"},{"img":"assets/images/17523923237583.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"0"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"true"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"false"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"无法判断"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"上述积木块是判断 “苹果” 这个字符串中是否包含 “果” 这个字符，显然 “苹果” 中是包含 “果” 的，所以结果为true。","auto":true},{"no":9,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"对角色casey编程：当按下→时，向右移动；当按下←时，向左移动；不按左右键时，原地不动。下列哪个选项不能实现这个功能？（ ）"},{"img":"assets/images/17523924033960.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17523924194746.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17523924259940.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17523924319238.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"img":"assets/images/17523924378235.png"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"根据选项B的程序，会让角色在不按“←”的时候增加x坐标，而不是按下“→”增加x坐标，因此错误。","auto":true},{"no":10,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"小猫程序对应的流程图和在舞台的位置如下图所示，运行程序后，小猫会说？（ ）"},{"img":"assets/images/17523924928176.png"},{"img":"assets/images/17523924989883.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"碰到气球"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"还差一点"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"先说“碰